<title>NEW ZEALAND: Habitat half year loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Habitat half year loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				0.10 vs 0.16 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				0.17 vs 1.10</p>
<p>Note - Habitat Group Ltd is a property developer.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
